  \[-\]config <option> <arg0> <arg1>\.\.\.: Configures the given option
      option: case <best/worst>: Sets the case \(currently: worst\)
      option: Ewarning <on/off>: treat errors as warnings or not \(currently: on\)
      option: freq <node id> <core frequency>: Sets the operating frequency in MHz for the given node
      option: from <ENDPOINT>: Sets the from endpoint
      option: looppoint <ANY>: Sets the loop point
      option: scale <true/false>: Configures whether results are scales \(currently: true\)
      option: srcpaths <paths>: Sets the \(semicolon separated\) source search path
      option: threads <core id> <num threads>: Sets number of threads currently executing for the given core
      option: timeout <seconds>: Sets the tools timeout on load
      option: Terror <on/off>: treat timing failures as errors or not \(currently: off\)
      option: to <ENDPOINT>: Sets the to endpoint
      option: verbosity <level>: Sets the tool verbosity level \(range: -10 -> \+10, default: 0\)
      option: Werror <on/off>: treat warnings as errors or not \(currently: off\)
